<title>JAPAN: Chiyoda -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Chiyoda -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 94.65		vs	    95.9</p>
<p> Operating	    3.61		vs	    3.86</p>
<p> Current		4.61		vs	    4.46</p>
<p> Net		    2.38		vs	    2.25</p>
<p> EPS		   51.16 yen	  vs	   48.36 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     46 million	  vs	  46 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.00 yen	  vs	    6.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Chiyoda Co Ltd is the largest shoe retailer.</p>
